@desowin, a general code remark regarding the thread-safety. I prefer something like:
```
    k_mutex_lock(&ctx->lock, K_FOREVER);
    ...
    rc = whatever...
    if (rc != 0) { /* an error condition */
        goto end;
    }
    ...
    everything ok (then normally rc = 0)
end:
    k_mutex_unlock(&ctx->lock);
    return rc;
```
